1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,167
No one taught us how to love.

2
00:00:02,167 --> 00:00:05,517
Can it be taught?

3
00:00:05,533 --> 00:00:07,043
You're not getting it.

4
00:00:07,533 --> 00:00:08,483
this isn't love,

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:09,367
understand?

6
00:00:09,367 --> 00:00:10,833
The love I imagined is a hundred times greater.

7
00:00:10,833 --> 00:00:11,353
A hundred times.

8
00:00:11,367 --> 00:00:12,167
Do you understand?

9
00:00:12,167 --> 00:00:12,527
I mean...

10
00:00:12,533 --> 00:00:13,293
I understand.

11
00:00:13,473 --> 00:00:15,400
You're not listening to me at all.

12
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:23,890
Love takes perseverance.

13
00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:24,610
Not abandoning.

14
00:00:24,610 --> 00:00:25,550
Not giving up.

15
00:00:25,550 --> 00:00:30,150
And security,

16
00:00:30,150 --> 00:00:32,400
To love, you need to feel secure.

